	(text
		"Not sure whether to use 2mm or 2.5mm pitch for JST connectors.\nOriginal PCB used 2mm, even though datasheet of encoder says\n2.5mm for the GA37-520. Used 2.5mm pitch for now.\n\nJST XH: 2.5mm pitch\nJST PH: 2.0mm pitch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 103.378 154.178 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "461ee7b1-2728-44b4-b8d1-f8d03f4444ab"))
	(text
		"Iout,max = 1.5A\nIout,max = Vref (gain) * Vref / RRS\nRRS = Vref (gain) * Vref / Iout,max\nRRS = 0.1 * 3.3V / 1.5A\nRRS = 0.2 Ohm 1%"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.162 133.604 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "7a41a3eb-bc45-4fb3-aa1b-7b3b0e6414a0"))
	(text
		"Voltage divider is fast enough (RC LP):\n6000 RPM = 100 rps\n100 rps x 12 ppr = 1200 pps\n4 x 1200 = 4800 Hz (1/T encoding)\nEncoder output rise/fall time: 300-1500 ns\nESP32 S3 typical pin capacitance: 2 pF\nTraces, cables, connectors: ~20 pF\nT = R x C = 5k1 x 22pF = 112.2ns => OK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.768 99.822 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "913d562a-2b8a-4ac1-9db2-5e52a08e492f"))
	(text
		"Logic input range:\nHigh: 2V - 5.5V\nLow:  0V - 0.8V\n3.3V logic inputs => OK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.416 83.566 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "bae3127f-9f94-41d5-9d41-1201ce67070a"))
